{"seq":3,"slug":"dimensionality-reduction","title":"降维","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/machine-learning/feature-engineering/dimensionality-reduction","wordCount":981,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"降维\">降维</h1><h2 id=\"为什么需要降维\">为什么需要降维</h2><p>降维（Dimensionality Reduction）将高维数据映射到低维空间，同时尽量保留数据的关键信息。在机器学习中，降维可以缓解维度灾难、加速训练、辅助可视化，并在一定程度上减少过拟合。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[&quot;高维数据&lt;br/&gt;d 维&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;降维算法&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;低维表示&lt;br/&gt;k 维&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;可视化&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; E[&quot;加速训练&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; F[&quot;去噪&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    A[\"高维数据&lt;br/&gt;d 维\"] --&gt; B[\"降维算法\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"低维表示&lt;br/&gt;k 维\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"可视化\"]\n    C --&gt; E[\"加速训练\"]\n    C --&gt; F[\"去噪\"]</pre><p>维度灾难（Curse of Dimensionality）指随着特征维度增加，样本在高维空间中变得极其稀疏，距离度量失效，模型难以有效学习。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>降维围绕三个概念展开：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>维度灾难（Curse of Dimensionality）</strong>：随着特征维度增加，样本在高维空间中变得极其稀疏，距离度量失效，模型难以有效学习。这是降维要解决的根本问题。</li>\n<li><strong>保留信息的能力</strong>：降维的难点在于&quot;降维&quot;与&quot;保信息&quot;的对抗。不同方法对&quot;什么算重要信息&quot;回答不同：PCA 保留<strong>方差</strong>，t-SNE 保留<strong>局部邻域</strong>，自编码器保留<strong>重构能力</strong>。</li>\n<li><strong>可变换新数据（Transform）</strong>：模型能否在不重新训练的前提下变换新样本。这是 PCA/UMAP/自编码器与 t-SNE 的关键差异，直接决定了方法能否用于线上推理。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>三者的取舍给出了一条实用的选择顺序：<strong>先试 PCA</strong>（快、可解释、可变换），不够再考虑非线性方法——<strong>可视化用 t-SNE/UMAP，特征学习用自编码器</strong>。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"pca-主成分分析\">PCA（主成分分析）</h2><p>PCA（Principal Component Analysis）是最经典的线性降维方法。它寻找数据方差最大的方向（主成分），将数据投影到这些方向上。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;中心化数据&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;计算协方差矩阵&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;特征值分解&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;按特征值排序&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;选择前 k 个特征向量&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; F[&quot;投影: X_new = X · W_k&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"中心化数据\"] --&gt; B[\"计算协方差矩阵\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"特征值分解\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"按特征值排序\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"选择前 k 个特征向量\"]\n    E --&gt; F[\"投影: X_new = X · W_k\"]</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import numpy as np&#10;from sklearn.decomposition import PCA&#10;from sklearn.datasets import load_digits&#10;from sklearn.model_selection import train_test_split&#10;from sklearn.linear_model import LogisticRegression&#10;&#10;digits = load_digits()&#10;X, y = digits.data, digits.target&#10;&#10;X_train, X_test, y_train, y_test = train_test_split(X, y, test_size=0.3, random_state=42)&#10;&#10;lr_full = LogisticRegression(max_iter=5000)&#10;lr_full.fit(X_train, y_train)&#10;print(f&quot;原始维度 ({X.shape[1]}): 准确率={lr_full.score(X_test, y_test):.4f}&quot;)&#10;&#10;for n in [10, 20, 30]:&#10;    pca = PCA(n_components=n)&#10;    X_train_pca = pca.fit_transform(X_train)&#10;    X_test_pca = pca.transform(X_test)&#10;&#10;    lr_pca = LogisticRegression(max_iter=5000)&#10;    lr_pca.fit(X_train_pca, y_train)&#10;&#10;    var_ratio = pca.explained_variance_ratio_.sum()&#10;    print(f&quot;PCA 降至 {n:2d} 维: 准确率={lr_pca.score(X_test_pca, y_test):.4f}  &quot;&#10;          f&quot;解释方差={var_ratio:.2%}&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> numpy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sklearn.decomposition </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> PCA</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sklearn.datasets </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> load_digits</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sklearn.model_selection </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> train_test_split</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sklearn.linear_model </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> LogisticRegression</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">digits </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> load_digits()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">X, y </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> digits.data, digits.target</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">X_train, X_test, y_train, y_test </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> train_test_split(X, y, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">test_size</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">random_state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">42</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">lr_full </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> LogisticRegression(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">max_iter</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">lr_full.fit(X_train, y_train)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"原始维度 (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">X.shape[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">): 准确率=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">lr_full.score(X_test, y_test)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:.4f</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    pca </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> PCA(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">n_components</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">n)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    X_train_pca </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pca.fit_transform(X_train)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    X_test_pca </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pca.transform(X_test)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    lr_pca </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> LogisticRegression(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">max_iter</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    lr_pca.fit(X_train_pca, y_train)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    var_ratio </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pca.explained_variance_ratio_.sum()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"PCA 降至 </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">n</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:2d</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 维: 准确率=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">lr_pca.score(X_test_pca, y_test)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:.4f</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  \"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">          f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"解释方差=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">var_ratio</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:.2%</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>PCA 的选择维度方法：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>策略</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>累计方差贡献率</td>\n<td>保留 95% 方差对应的维度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>碎石图</td>\n<td>寻找特征值下降的&quot;肘部&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>交叉验证</td>\n<td>用下游任务性能选择维度</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"t-sne\">t-SNE</h2><p>t-SNE（t-distributed Stochastic Neighbor Embedding）是一种非线性降维方法，擅长将高维数据嵌入到 2D 或 3D 空间进行可视化。它保留数据的局部邻域结构。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from sklearn.manifold import TSNE&#10;from sklearn.datasets import load_digits&#10;import numpy as np&#10;&#10;digits = load_digits()&#10;X, y = digits.data, digits.target&#10;&#10;tsne = TSNE(n_components=2, perplexity=30, random_state=42)&#10;X_2d = tsne.fit_transform(X)&#10;&#10;print(f&quot;原始维度: {X.shape[1]} → t-SNE 维度: {X_2d.shape[1]}&quot;)&#10;&#10;for digit in range(10):&#10;    mask = y == digit&#10;    center = X_2d[mask].mean(axis=0)&#10;    print(f&quot;  数字 {digit}: 中心=({center[0]:7.2f}, {center[1]:7.2f})  样本数={mask.sum()}&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sklearn.manifold </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> TSNE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sklearn.datasets </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> load_digits</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> numpy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">digits </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> load_digits()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">X, y </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> digits.data, digits.target</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">tsne </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> TSNE(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">n_components</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">perplexity</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">random_state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">42</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">X_2d </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tsne.fit_transform(X)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"原始维度: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">X.s